mwan3.config_files [CBI.DynamicList] Files/Directories to Sync: item=mwan3
  help: UCI names (e.g., "openvpn") or absolute paths (e.g., "/etc/openvpn/keys").
<button> Dismiss
<button> Save
==== lease-sync-advanced
h2: High Availability - Advanced Lease Sync
Tuning for high-churn environments, unreliable networks, or troubleshooting.
h3: Lease-Sync Tuning
Default values work for most deployments.
advanced.lease_sync_port [CBI.Value] Sync Port: value=5379 (placeholder "5378")
  help: UDP port for lease sync.
advanced.lease_sync_interval [CBI.Value] Sync Interval: value=20 (placeholder "30")
  help: Seconds between full sync requests. Safety net for missed updates.
advanced.lease_sync_peer_timeout [CBI.Value] Peer Timeout: value=80 (placeholder "120")
  help: Seconds without heartbeat before peer is offline. Should be 4x sync_interval.
advanced.lease_sync_persist_interval [CBI.Value] Persist Interval: value=300 (placeholder "60")
  help: Seconds between disk writes. Increase to 300 for flash storage.
advanced.lease_sync_log_level [CBI.ListValue] Log Level: select=3 {0,1,2,3}
  help: Use Debug (3) for troubleshooting sync issues.
